  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with internet humor that mocks physical appearance and uses racially charged names. The target community likely includes individuals who find humor in body-shaming tropes and may be unaware or indifferent to the potential harm caused by mocking someone’s physical size, especially when combined with the use of the name 'Mohammad' to imply targeting Muslim or Arab individuals. The meme appeals to those who enjoy or participate in online culture that trivializes personal experiences and engages in stereotypes, particularly those that intersect with Islamophobia and ableism.",
